    "updated_at": "2021-03-12T19:57:32Z",
    "body": "I recently came across the Clipboard API, which is similar in many ways. That API deals in `ClipboardItem` objects, each of which can have multiple types. Perhaps something similar to this would make sense for a modernized drag and drop API?",
