    "updated_at": "2021-03-13T01:53:37Z",
    "body": "yes, new [async clipboard API](https://www.w3.org/TR/clipboard-apis/#navigator-interface) is exactly designed to handle this use case of reading or putting multiple items per copy/paste/cut. See a [WebKit's blog post](https://webkit.org/blog/10855/async-clipboard-api/) for this exact use case being addressed.",
